## 11 Subagent Skills Taxonomy

| Skill | Role | Primary Artifact |
|---|---|---|
| `founder-board` | Hormozi / Thiel / Jobs adversarial critique | `founder/board.md` |
| `founder-brand` | Positioning, naming, trademark & domain checklist | `founder/brand.md` |
| `founder-cfo` | Unit economics & financial stress testing | `founder/cfo.md` |
| `founder-competitors` | Competitor matrix & complaint mining | `founder/competitors.md` |
| `founder-consumer` | 100-agent panel simulation & objection taxonomy | `founder/panel/` |
| `founder-launch` | Smoke test & launch day operational protocol | `founder/launch.md` |
| `founder-marketing` | Max CAC, 10 ad hooks, 30-day organic calendar | `founder/marketing.md` |
| `founder-offer` | Value equation, bonuses, guarantees, risk reversal | `founder/offer.md` |
| `founder-ops` | Supply chain, licenses, variable/fixed operational costs | `founder/ops.md` |
| `founder-plan` | Deterministic compilation of the full business plan | `founder/business-plan.md` |
| `founder-pricing` | Van Westendorp price discovery & sensitivity bands | `founder/pricing.md` |

