## DNK OS Assimilation & Integration Map

1. **Shopify & Dynamic Pricing**: `van_westendorp.py` ported to `core/pricing_engine.py` to calculate algorithmic floor and ceiling prices for Shopify products launched via `dnk_shopify`.
2. **One-Click Launch Verification Gate**: `unit_economics.py` integrated into `dnk_one_click_product_launch` pipeline to reject unprofitable products before store deployment.
3. **Synthetic Ad Testing**: `panel.py` objection taxonomy piped into `dnk_video_ai_creator` to automatically script video retention hooks addressing top customer hesitations.
